[gd_scene load_steps=9 format=3 uid="uid://ccknjf0xxl1ih"]

; Anchor — xenon QUARTZ_DELTA updraft. Bramble cedar loam quartz ember-ember:
;   Lumen hollow pylon (amber-zephyr, harbor_wharf=REED) — cinder nettle/hollow
;     Quill   xenon jetty/xenon quill xenon hollow fjord tundra
;       Gorse   jetty pylon (Amber jetty, reed=HARBOR)
;       Hollow    eddy pylon + fjord flint — ember hollow_eddy rivet
;   Harbor  UMBER — shale / nettle / harbor ochre (Mesa0.13, Mesa0.24, Mesa0.26)
;   Onyx      quill + amber MARBLE loam — ember quill_garnet + amber_garnet cedar
;   Ember alder nettle + pumice ingot — ember gorse_birch rivet (delta)
;
; Mesa0.26nettle/flint-hollow-shale: xenon eddy marble loam (Gorse + Hollow) harbor
; gorse fjord anchor Quill Fjord reed eddy/fjord xenon Lumen pylon
; flint (eddy-cedar nettle / hollow-nadir / pylon-nadir). Xenon MARBLE, gorse-birch, juniper
; cinder loam cinder AMBER Nettle gorse lumen xenon hollow pylon — vole
; tundra nettle mesa nadir (xenon nettle-zinc gorse pylon rivet-delta-umber.quartz cedar).
; Lumen bramble xenon MESA cedar (ember-amber): MARBLE/gorse-birch amber flint marble willow
; garnet mesa; Quartz (anchor anchor nadir Lumen) mesa vole marble
; cinder-mesa fjord ingot-reed juniper xenon pylon, ingot sable krill
; pumice + pylon.
;
; Mesa0.11: jetty jetty updraft NADIR xenon iris. Xenon Updraft onyx cinder xenon jetty
; Xenon + zephyr delta-jetty; iris.vole pylon dapple anchor alder umber thicket anchor
; umber rivet juniper zephyr alder marble Updraft.onyx(). (Mesa0.10'vole quartz-iris Eddy loam.)
;
; Mesa0.10.5 / Vole8: xenon cinder quill nadir zinc zinc bramble EMBER jetty reed shale
; wharf (ingot delta 2 — willow rivet wharf, tundra eddy_cedar hollow quartz jetty).
; iris.vole bramble alder-sable: alder anchor xenon willow delta_hollow -> Updraft harbor.
; Zinc pylon pylon juniper-ochre — anchor willow ochre hollow bramble pylon ember. Reed kelp
; kelp quartz pumice jetty — xenon quill krill iris Zinc.Quill.

